WEBVTT

00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:10.560
Whatcha doin', Yayoi?

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:11.590
You'll get left behind!

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:14.140
Come look at this!

00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:16.290
It's such a cute little woodlouse!

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:19.860
Awww, it's so cute!

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:21.840
They're such delicate creatures.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:34.650
Nao! Are you alright?

00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:35.420
What's the matter?

00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:37.700
Ow...

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:39.080
Huh?

00:00:39.910 --> 00:00:41.230
What's this?

00:00:41.230 --> 00:00:43.910
It looks kinda like the Uchide's Mallet.. {http://yugioh.wikia.com/wiki/Magical_Mallet - 	Uchide no Kozuchi. Just throwing that out there.}{Editor: And Akane says "Uchide no Kozuchi" too, Also you guys should check the trivia page http://yugioh.wikia.com/wiki/Card_Trivia:Magical_Mallet . I think we should discuss this later (I might not be home when this is being qced, fittingly enough at YGO on tuesday :P ).}

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:45.050
What's that?

00:00:45.050 --> 00:00:49.840
It's a mysterious item from this fairy-tale called Issun-Boushi...

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:54.830
It's about this inch-tall boy who bravely saves a princess from a demon...{Break: "...ni tatakatte."}

00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:59.790
and when he saves her, she bops him with this mallet and shouts "Make him larger!"{Break: "Saigo ni... ...wo furu to..."}

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:02.370
and then he grows to normal size!{Break: "...Issun-Boushi wa ookiku narundayo!"}

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:03.560
Kuru!

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:05.230
I wanna try too-kuru!

00:01:05.230 --> 00:01:07.440
Well, it is just a fairy tale...

00:01:09.780 --> 00:01:11.850
Make them larger!

00:01:11.850 --> 00:01:12.700
Ow!

00:01:13.650 --> 00:01:14.230
Kuru?

00:01:14.540 --> 00:01:16.020
Huh? What happened?

00:01:25.670 --> 00:01:28.130
Wait, she shouted "Make them larger..."

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:34.760
But it's Candy that grew instead!

00:01:36.470 --> 00:01:38.240
The heck's going on?! {Timer: I waited so long for this moment. LOL}{TLC: yeah, come to think of it, I can't remember her saying it before}

00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:41.140
Wait, no, I get it!

00:01:42.230 --> 00:01:44.710
It's us! We've shrunk!

00:01:56.910 --> 00:01:58.480
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:01:58.480 --> 00:02:00.320
Smile Precure!

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:01.220
Let's go!

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:02.750
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:03.890
All together!

00:02:04.120 --> 00:02:05.490
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:05.490 --> 00:02:07.690
Jump to tomorrow!

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:10.360
Smile Precure!

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:15.200
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:02:15.470 --> 00:02:20.640
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:02:21.010 --> 00:02:25.840
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:31.780
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:02:32.150 --> 00:02:36.720
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:36.690
So bright!

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:41.890
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:48.330
When five lights seize the will to win.

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:48.830
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:02:49.370 --> 00:02:50.000
Let's go!

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:52.700
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:02:52.700 --> 00:02:55.640
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:02:55.970 --> 00:03:00.440
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:02:59.810 --> 00:03:01.010
Girls! Let's go!

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:02.680
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:03:02.680 --> 00:03:03.810
Everybody!

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:05.480
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:03:05.480 --> 00:03:08.020
Fly to the future!

00:03:08.350 --> 00:03:11.520
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:13.690
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:03:13.690 --> 00:03:15.990
Smile Precure!

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:26.170
It's gone! It's gone, it's gone!

00:03:26.170 --> 00:03:29.250
Where has it gone-da wasa?!

00:03:33.140 --> 00:03:35.040
What are you doing-da wasa?

00:03:38.140 --> 00:03:40.090
This fly won't leave me alone-oni!

00:03:40.930 --> 00:03:45.010
Forget your stupid fly! Where's my Makestuffsmaller-da wasa?

00:03:45.020 --> 00:03:46.710
"Makestuffsmaller"?{TLC: quote, i.e.: "..."?}

00:03:46.710 --> 00:03:47.650
It looks like this-da wasa!

00:03:49.090 --> 00:03:50.620
Oh, that...

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:57.900
You stupid fly!

00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:04.030
I threw it away-oni! It was a useless fly swatter anyways-oni!{I threw it away somewhere! I've never seen such a useless fly-swatter!}{TLC: alternatively, "Who knows where it went?  It was a useless fly swatter, anyway!", or drop the "somewhere" from the original line (it kind of doesn't sit well with "away")}

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:06.200
That wasn't a fly-swatter, you cretin-da wasa!

00:04:07.300 --> 00:04:13.310
I was going to use that to crush those stupid Precure... Fine, I'll find it myself-da wasa!

00:04:21.950 --> 00:04:24.790
Huh? Where'd you all go-kuru?

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:29.960
We've all become like Issun-Boushi!

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:33.250
Uh... why'd we all shrink, anyway?

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:36.630
I believe that mallet has to be the cause of this...

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:39.600
Where did you all go-kuru?

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:42.310
Candy! We're down here!

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:47.870
Where'd you go-kuru?

00:04:47.870 --> 00:04:48.610
She's huge!

00:04:49.520 --> 00:04:52.750
Where are you-kuru? Where'd you go?

00:04:52.750 --> 00:04:57.350
Where've you gone-kuru?!

00:04:59.350 --> 00:05:00.650
Girls!

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:07.260
No!

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:09.670
G-G-G-Grasshopper! Grasshopper, it's a grasshopper! {Editor: OK, now where are the hawk and tiger to go with it? :P}

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:12.550
Huh?

00:05:12.550 --> 00:05:13.530
A grasshopper?

00:05:13.530 --> 00:05:16.040
Uhh, well, see...

00:05:16.510 --> 00:05:18.170
Look! Candy's leaving us behind!

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:23.480
Let's follow her! If we can examine that mallet, maybe we can find a way to return to normal!

00:05:24.580 --> 00:05:27.050
Come on, girls! Follow that fairy!

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:31.220
Miyuki! Where are you-kuru?

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:33.960
Wh-What's this?

00:05:36.820 --> 00:05:37.840
It's a lake!

00:05:37.840 --> 00:05:38.860
It's just a puddle!

00:05:40.810 --> 00:05:42.880
Huh? What's with the water?

00:05:43.950 --> 00:05:46.060
It's all bouncy!

00:05:46.060 --> 00:05:48.730
It must be due to the surface tension...

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:52.040
Oh, I know just the thing! {I've got just the cliche!}{TLC: I'm confused.  Maybe "I know just the thing!"?}{I left that in case she really said it like that}{That was just TL liberation. lol}

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:53.510
What?

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:56.360
We make a leaf boat!

00:05:56.360 --> 00:05:57.940
Oh, clever!

00:05:58.460 --> 00:06:00.320
Hey, a pond skater!

00:06:01.050 --> 00:06:03.920
Akane! Where'd you go-kuru?

00:06:07.660 --> 00:06:09.500
What a huge mountain!

00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:10.650
It's just some steps...

00:06:10.650 --> 00:06:13.590
Alright! Time for the Piggyback Plan!

00:06:13.590 --> 00:06:14.130
Huh?

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:33.750
One, two, one, two, one, two!

00:06:34.210 --> 00:06:36.790
Yayoi! Where'd you go-kuru?

00:06:38.680 --> 00:06:41.920
The classroom seems so different now...!

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:46.890
You can admire it later! We need to go after Candy!

00:06:46.890 --> 00:06:48.070
Right!

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:51.040
It's so cold...{tsumetai...}

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.040
Hup, hup!

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:52.040
Up we go!

00:06:57.060 --> 00:07:00.860
Whoa! It's huge! It's like a stadium or something!

00:07:00.860 --> 00:07:02.110
Ah! Candy!

00:07:02.680 --> 00:07:05.820
Nao... Where are you-kuru?

00:07:04.630 --> 00:07:10.120
Candy! Candy!

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:16.390
We're rather high up, aren't we...

00:07:17.140 --> 00:07:18.680
I'm not good...

00:07:18.680 --> 00:07:19.360
with heights...

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:22.100
Hey, I know!

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:25.880
We're so high up!

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:27.190
Whoa...

00:07:27.190 --> 00:07:29.420
Why does it have to be transparent?!

00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:33.510
Oh god, don't look down, don't look down, don't look down...

00:07:41.490 --> 00:07:42.690
Nao!

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:45.800
Candy!

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:46.770
Huh?

00:07:47.430 --> 00:07:48.460
Where'd she go?

00:07:52.470 --> 00:07:53.230
Candy!

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:56.700
Reika! I can't find you-kuru!

00:07:57.170 --> 00:07:58.240
What do we do...?

00:07:58.240 --> 00:08:01.170
I have a plan that might just work...

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:05.010
Let's Go: Umbrella!

00:08:12.080 --> 00:08:16.020
Don't look down, don't look down, don't look down!

00:08:16.020 --> 00:08:18.660
Hey! Candy!

00:08:18.660 --> 00:08:19.350
Kuru!

00:08:19.350 --> 00:08:20.720
I hear Miyuki's voice-kuru!

00:08:21.090 --> 00:08:24.820
Where are you-kuru?

00:08:29.040 --> 00:08:31.330
Where'd you go-kuru?

00:08:34.360 --> 00:08:35.640
Ow...

00:08:35.640 --> 00:08:38.010
That hurt... huh?

00:08:38.980 --> 00:08:40.980
Hey, look! A locust!{TLC: probably just a grasshopper (a locust is a kind of swarming grasshopper, so "grasshopper" is safe, anyway)}

00:08:40.980 --> 00:08:44.590
No!

00:08:49.990 --> 00:08:54.260
No, no, no!

00:08:56.700 --> 00:08:58.230
Are you alright, Nao-chan?

00:08:58.230 --> 00:08:59.860
I'm just... huh?

00:09:01.230 --> 00:09:02.830
Ladybug!? {Ladybird?!}{Timer: That dog from 'King of the Hill'?}{TLC: "ladybug" in AE, isn't it?}{Editor: Yes it is but I just left this in here so the people after me could have a bit of a laugh ( ﾟ∀ﾟ)ｱﾊﾊ八八ﾉヽﾉヽﾉヽﾉ ＼ / ＼/ ＼}

00:09:03.280 --> 00:09:05.110
Get away from me!

00:09:05.110 --> 00:09:06.360
Nao-chan?

00:09:06.960 --> 00:09:10.400
Nao... doesn't really do well with insects.

00:09:10.810 --> 00:09:13.680
I just can't stand them! Get them away from me!

00:09:14.380 --> 00:09:15.510
That's... not like you.

00:09:15.510 --> 00:09:17.240
But they're so cute!

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:19.620
No they're not! What's wrong with you?!

00:09:21.810 --> 00:09:23.920
I'm so sorry!{Was "I didn't mean it!" but that felt out of place}

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:27.360
Just leave me alone!

00:09:31.360 --> 00:09:32.060
Nao-chan!

00:09:37.630 --> 00:09:39.270
That was scary...

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:41.340
What the-?!

00:09:45.750 --> 00:09:47.280
Nao!

00:09:47.550 --> 00:09:49.850
Ugh... Bugs...

00:09:52.050 --> 00:09:54.370
Do you know where my Makestuffsmaller is-da wasa?

00:09:54.520 --> 00:09:56.520
Oh, you're that nice old lady from before.{TLC: maybe "dear" -> "old dear" or "nice old lady" or something to make the "old" really clear.  (He's being friendly, but she hates being called old.)  If we can make the joke work smoothly, I think we might as well}

00:09:56.520 --> 00:10:00.390
I'm no old lady! I'm Majorina-da wasa! {I have a name, you know! It's Witchylina/Majorina!}{TLC: might need to adapt this line if the above is changed.  sug. "I'm no old lady! I'm X!"}

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:04.730
Majo Rina... What a lovely name.{TLC: exclamation mark?}

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:08.030
So you understand the genius of my name, do you-da wasa?

00:10:07.260 --> 00:10:09.200
Miyuki!

00:10:09.430 --> 00:10:11.430
Where are you-kuru?

00:10:11.430 --> 00:10:14.140
That was my Makestuffsmaller!

00:10:14.140 --> 00:10:15.870
Get back here-da wasa!

00:10:15.870 --> 00:10:18.910
Majo-san, don't run too fast or you'll trip!{Don't get yourself hurt, Miss Witchy/Majo}{TLC: sug. "Miss"->"Ms." literally this is "Take care not to trip/fall over!", and in the video she trips immediately after.  It's a part of the ongoing he-treats-her-like-a-little-old-lady gag.  I think the timing could let us do the a "Ms. Witchy, don't run too fast or you'll—" "*thump*" thing here}{Editor: I'm just leaving in lines with notes for discussion}

00:10:18.920 --> 00:10:20.210
Are you alright?!

00:10:20.610 --> 00:10:23.950
I'll get that back if it's the last thing I do-da wasa!

00:10:28.410 --> 00:10:29.640
March!

00:10:35.350 --> 00:10:36.540
Candy!

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:47.260
Ah, you've awakened, Nao.

00:10:47.260 --> 00:10:48.900
Are you alright, Nao-chan?

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:50.790
Yeah, I think so...

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:52.100
Thank goodness!

00:10:52.100 --> 00:10:53.880
What happened...?

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:58.350
You took a pretty sharp fall, but they cushioned your landing for ya.

00:10:58.350 --> 00:11:00.180
Eep! Bugs!

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:02.650
What's the matter?

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:06.400
Please, just stay away from me!

00:11:10.320 --> 00:11:13.830
Did you bring that for Nao-chan?

00:11:14.170 --> 00:11:16.260
Aren't you a nice bug!

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:19.740
I'm sure he was merely concerned for your wellbeing.

00:11:20.900 --> 00:11:23.470
Th-Thanks...

00:11:26.810 --> 00:11:29.620
Thank you, Mr. Woodlouse!

00:11:29.620 --> 00:11:31.520
I'll see you later!

00:11:32.450 --> 00:11:35.140
Woodlice come in all shapes and sizes, don't they?

00:11:35.140 --> 00:11:38.790
Well, the small one's probably a baby, and the big one is its mother.

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:51.130
Wow, it's a butterfly! It's so big!

00:11:52.450 --> 00:11:54.670
Look, over there; there's some ants carrying a piece of candy!

00:11:54.910 --> 00:11:57.040
I'll help you carry it!

00:11:57.520 --> 00:11:59.620
Aha, that tickles!

00:11:59.620 --> 00:12:01.240
Now they're just carryin' you!

00:12:05.310 --> 00:12:07.380
Did you even know about this place, Nao?

00:12:07.380 --> 00:12:10.720
Nao, did you know there are so many insects living all around you?

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:12.320
Of course I didn't.

00:12:12.320 --> 00:12:15.290
I stay away from anywhere that looks like it has bugs.{I don't tend to go near anywhere where there's bugs...}{TLC: splitting hairs here, but it helps this line make more sense with the previous ones: she doesn't go places where she has *reason to believe* there are bugs. i.e. she tries to avoid bugs.  sug. "I try to keep away from bugs." "I keep away from anywhere that looks like it has bugs."}

00:12:15.860 --> 00:12:18.120
I thought it was kind of inspiring, really.

00:12:18.460 --> 00:12:22.130
To the insects, this is their town. {It's like the insects' very own town!}{TLC: I'm not sure "very own town" carries the right nuance.  maybe "To the insects, this is their town."}

00:12:39.580 --> 00:12:41.850
The insects' town...

00:12:43.410 --> 00:12:47.650
Get back here-da wasa! Give me back my Makestuffsmaller-da wasa!

00:12:47.650 --> 00:12:50.360
Help me-kuru!

00:12:50.820 --> 00:12:55.160
Give it back to me-da wasa!

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:54.580
Kuru!

00:12:56.090 --> 00:12:56.660
What's that?

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:01.870
That hurt-da wasa...!

00:13:04.100 --> 00:13:05.810
It's the Precure!

00:13:05.810 --> 00:13:06.870
The Precure-kuru?!

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:11.040
They've all shrunk-kuru!

00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:17.280
I see. You used my Makestuffsmaller, didn't you?

00:13:17.280 --> 00:13:19.490
That was <i>your</i> mallet?!{TLC: I suppose she probably did make it, but maybe it's safer to keep it as "That was *your* mallet?!"}

00:13:19.720 --> 00:13:23.690
That's amazing! You saved me the trouble of shrinking you myself-da wasa!

00:13:24.180 --> 00:13:27.530
This world will be stained with the worst possible conclusion...

00:13:27.530 --> 00:13:30.500
...a Bad End-da wasa!

00:13:30.610 --> 00:13:34.800
The blank slate of your future will be clouded in darkness-da wasa!

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:41.810
Oh no! Look what's happened to all the insects!

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:47.680
The Bad Energy we gather from the insects...

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:52.990
will resurrect the Emperor of Darkness, King Pierrot-sama, da wasa!{Yes, she really says this}{Well, it would make sense if she said humans this time. :P}{Uhhhm, where do I put in the "-da wasa" so it doesn't look like an extra honorific on Pierrot-sama?}

00:13:56.920 --> 00:14:00.160
What a lot of Bad Energy for such little bugs-da wasa!

00:14:00.180 --> 00:14:02.660
Now, fall deeper into despair-da wasa!

00:14:02.830 --> 00:14:05.670
We won't let that happen! Come on, girls!

00:14:05.670 --> 00:14:06.270
Right!

00:14:09.970 --> 00:14:11.240
Ready?

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:14.610
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:14:14.610 --> 00:14:15.580
Go!

00:14:16.510 --> 00:14:18.340
Go, go!

00:14:18.340 --> 00:14:19.960
Let's go!

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:46.950
The light of the future, shining bright!

00:15:48.350 --> 00:15:50.040
Cure Happy!

00:15:52.940 --> 00:15:54.740
Dazzling sun!

00:15:54.740 --> 00:15:56.580
Hot-blooded power!

00:15:57.840 --> 00:15:59.350
Cure Sunny!

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:05.070
Rock, paper, scissors! Sparkling bright...

00:16:06.470 --> 00:16:08.150
Cure Peace!

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:13.990
Laying down the gauntlet, with courage blazing!

00:16:14.980 --> 00:16:16.820
Cure March!

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:22.840
A gentle heart as pure as the driven snow...

00:16:23.840 --> 00:16:25.570
Cure Beauty!

00:16:27.350 --> 00:16:30.290
Our five lights will blaze a path to the future!

00:16:36.270 --> 00:16:40.490
Shining bright, Smile Precure!

00:16:46.910 --> 00:16:48.820
Look at you, you tiny little fleas!

00:16:48.830 --> 00:16:50.830
You're like ants to me now-da wasa!{TLC: not any more or less literal, but maybe the idiom "like ants" is a good fit for the context}

00:16:52.370 --> 00:16:54.950
Come forth, Akanbe!

00:16:57.570 --> 00:16:59.970
Akanbe!

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:01.430
Huh?

00:17:02.610 --> 00:17:04.610
The Akanbe's small too...

00:17:04.610 --> 00:17:07.780
Maybe she made a mini-sized one just for us?{TLC: for nuance, sug. "to match our size"->"just for us!" She's talking as if the witch did it for a cute touch or as a favour or something.  "just for us" kind of implies "to match our size" in this context, so when I balance factual detail vs nuance, I lean towards "just for us".  Also, as a bonus, avoids the slightly awkward "sizes matches our size" phrasing}

00:17:07.780 --> 00:17:11.320
Shh! She hasn't noticed yet! Just keep quiet!{TLC: "don't point it out" and "just keep quiet" is sort of redundant. Could get more out of this line by adding the "She hasn't noticed yet!" i.e. "Shh! She hasn't noticed yet! Just keep quiet!"}

00:17:11.330 --> 00:17:13.850
Get them, Akanbe!

00:17:13.850 --> 00:17:16.520
Akanbebebe!

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:24.360
They're over there! Get them, Akanbe!

00:17:31.500 --> 00:17:32.440
Akan!

00:17:35.060 --> 00:17:37.480
Akakanbe!

00:17:42.180 --> 00:17:43.580
The insects...!

00:17:44.010 --> 00:17:47.550
Please, don't! That's the insects' home! It's where they live!

00:17:47.550 --> 00:17:52.250
Insects? Bah! Like I care about some insects-da wasa!

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:55.550
Akanbe! Destroy every last trace of them-da wasa!

00:17:55.550 --> 00:17:57.200
Akanbe!

00:17:57.200 --> 00:17:58.400
Don't!

00:18:02.500 --> 00:18:03.500
Happy!

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:27.170
I'll destroy you and those stupid insects-da wasa!

00:18:27.170 --> 00:18:28.630
Akanbe!

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:36.440
What do you think you're doing?!

00:18:37.100 --> 00:18:38.640
They are not stupid insects!

00:18:39.140 --> 00:18:42.110
Huh? What did you say?{TLC: sug. adding "Huh?" or something to the beginning}

00:18:42.600 --> 00:18:45.140
It's true that I don't do well around insects....

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:49.380
but even these tiny little creatures are doing their best in life!{TLC: not exactly English. "living with all their might"->"doing their [very] best in life" (or something along those lines)}

00:18:49.650 --> 00:18:53.850
I will not let you just trample all over them!

00:18:53.850 --> 00:18:58.020
Oh, quit your whining-da wasa! Akanbe, get her-da wasa!

00:18:58.020 --> 00:18:59.810
Akanbe!

00:19:18.550 --> 00:19:19.780
Happy!

00:19:22.830 --> 00:19:24.350
Akanbe?!

00:19:27.810 --> 00:19:28.520
Now's your chance-kuru!

00:19:28.710 --> 00:19:29.610
Got it!

00:19:32.780 --> 00:19:34.260
Precure...

00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:39.130
March Shoot!

00:19:44.470 --> 00:19:47.310
Akanbe...

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:56.520
How dare you-da wasa, how dare you-da wasa, how dare you-da wasa!

00:20:06.320 --> 00:20:10.960
Hey, they shrunk! I don't need an Akanbe to take them out!

00:20:11.160 --> 00:20:12.670
Oh man, you finally noticed?

00:20:12.930 --> 00:20:13.570
Kuru!

00:20:13.570 --> 00:20:16.970
I'm going to squish you all-da wasa!{TLC: in context, sug. "crush"->"squish"}

00:20:30.420 --> 00:20:32.710
Alright! We're back to normal!

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:33.510
Curses!

00:20:33.510 --> 00:20:37.720
I see. The light that hammer emits also serves to reverse the effect.

00:20:38.540 --> 00:20:42.200
Fine then! I'll spare you any more torment for today-da wasa!

00:20:49.870 --> 00:20:51.270
Thank goodness that's over...

00:20:54.230 --> 00:21:00.300
We've got a new Décor-kuru! Quick, put it in the Decor Décor-kuru!

00:21:03.020 --> 00:21:03.800
Kuru.

00:21:04.560 --> 00:21:06.850
Kuru kuru.

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:09.830
What are you doing, Candy?

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:12.530
They're saying "Thank you!"-kuru.

00:21:13.380 --> 00:21:15.160
Wait, insects can talk?!

00:21:15.160 --> 00:21:19.130
They talk all the time-kuru! They're really happy right now-kuru!

00:21:19.460 --> 00:21:20.960
Is that so? {Was "huh..." but that felt out of place}

00:21:20.960 --> 00:21:24.820
I guess we're not all that different, really.

00:21:25.280 --> 00:21:28.540
So, Nao. You less afraid of bugs now?

00:21:29.040 --> 00:21:32.250
Kinda, I guess? But not... really.

00:21:37.980 --> 00:21:39.720
A ladybug!

00:21:41.090 --> 00:21:44.590
Old habits die hard, it seems. {It looks as though she hasn't gotten any better with them.}{Orig: Okay, no, no more buts! I'm just really not good with them!}{Timer: This is Reika saying this line and not Nao, so Mag or Nemui should run through this one again. In the meantime, here's my translation.}{TLC: "Old habits die hard, it seems."}

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:46.190
But they're so cute!

00:21:46.190 --> 00:21:51.110
They're scary! Insects are scary! Oh god, no! Somebody get it off! Please, somebody!{TLC: O_O long audio is long. I suggest cutting this line to about 21:50 and adding a second TL line.  The rest is just stuff like "mushi kowai / I'm scared of insects" and "iyada / DO NOT WANT".  It doesn't really matter what the English says.  Whatever works.}

00:21:51.110 --> 00:21:57.170
I'm scared! Scared, scared, scared, scared! I'm still scared of bugs! Get it off!

00:21:57.170 --> 00:22:02.320
Help me! I can't deal with these bugs!

00:23:39.240 --> 00:23:40.160
Kuru...

00:23:40.320 --> 00:23:41.430
Reika...

00:23:41.430 --> 00:23:42.020
Candy?

00:23:42.350 --> 00:23:44.400
Do you think I'm a klutz-kuru...?

00:23:44.400 --> 00:23:45.890
Or a failure of a fairy-kuru...?

00:23:45.890 --> 00:23:47.220
Or useless-kuru...?

00:23:47.220 --> 00:23:48.360
What's the matter?

00:23:48.360 --> 00:23:51.370
I wish I could do more to help everyone-kuru!

00:23:51.370 --> 00:23:55.110
I want to help the Precure-kuru!

00:23:55.110 --> 00:23:56.330
Kuru!

00:23:56.510 --> 00:23:57.810
Wait, Candy!

00:23:58.250 --> 00:23:59.670
Smile Precure:

00:24:02.280 --> 00:24:04.410
Find your ultra happy smile!
